 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They brought the donkey and the colt",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And put their cloaks on them",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he sat on them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of the crowd spread their cloaks on the road",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Others cut branches from the trees",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And spread them on the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the crowds that went before him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And that followed him were shouting",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hosanna to the Son of David",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hosanna in the highest",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hosanna",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 1,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And when he entered Jerusalem",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole city was stirred up",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is this, they said",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the prophet Jesus from Nazareth of Galilee",
